#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:2
msgid "Architecture"
msgstr "Architecture"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:5
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Descripción general"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:7
msgid ""
"Layouts 1.3 and 2.0 use the |morpheus| Agent's QuorumCheckService for "
"high availability. This architecture replaces the Pacemaker-based "
"resource management used by Legacy layouts, providing tighter integration"
" with the |morpheus| platform and simplified operations."
msgstr ""
"Los layouts 1.3 y 2.0 utilizan QuorumCheckService del Agente |morpheus| "
"para alta disponibilidad. Esta arquitectura reemplaza la administración "
"de recursos basada en Pacemaker utilizada por layouts Legacy, "
"proporcionando una integración más estrecha con la plataforma |morpheus| "
"y operaciones simplificadas."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:9
msgid "Note"
msgstr "Nota"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:9
msgid ""
"This page applies to layouts 1.3 and 2.0. For the Pacemaker architecture "
"used by Legacy layouts, see :doc:`/infrastructure/clusters/mvm`."
msgstr ""
"Esta página se aplica a los layouts 1.3 y 2.0. Para la arquitectura "
"Pacemaker utilizada por layouts Legacy, consulte "
":doc:`/infrastructure/clusters/mvm`."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:12
msgid "Component Stack"
msgstr "Component Stack"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:14
msgid "Layouts 1.3 and 2.0 rely on three core components:"
msgstr "Los diseños 1.3 y 2.0 dependen de tres componentes principales:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:16
msgid "**Corosync**: Cluster membership and messaging layer"
msgstr "**Corosync**: Clúster membership y messaging layer"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:17
msgid ""
"**DLM (Distributed Lock Manager)**: Coordinates file locks for the HPE "
"Clustered Datastore (GFS2) filesystem"
msgstr ""
"**DLM (Distributed Lock Manager)**: Coordinates archivo locks para el HPE"
" Clustered Almacén de datos (GFS2) filesystem"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:18
msgid ""
"**Morpheus Agent (QuorumCheckService)**: Quorum decisions, failure "
"detection, fencing, and recovery orchestration"
msgstr ""
"**Morpheus Agent (QuorumCheckService)**: Quorum decisions, fallo "
"detection, fencing, y recuperación orchestration"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:21
msgid "Quorum Algorithm"
msgstr "Quorum Algorithm"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:23
msgid ""
"The |morpheus| agent on each host runs a QuorumCheckService that "
"continuously monitors cluster health and makes quorum decisions."
msgstr ""
"El |morpheus| agent en cada host ejecuta un QuorumCheckService ese "
"continuously monitors cluster health y hace quorum decisions."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:26
msgid "Peer Communication"
msgstr "Peer Communication"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:28
msgid "Each host exposes a ``/quorum`` endpoint on port 7443"
msgstr "Cada host exposes un ``/quorum`` endpoint en puerto 7443"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:29
msgid "Hosts ping each other every 20 seconds"
msgstr "Hosts ping cada otro cada 20 seconds"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:30
msgid "A node is considered unreachable after 60 seconds with no response"
msgstr "Un nodo es considered unreachable después de 60 seconds con no respuesta"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:31
msgid ""
"On a two-node GFS2 cluster, both Hosts ping each other on TCP 7443 and "
"must also reach the Distributed Worker URL. Do not apply same-site peer "
"cross-verification to this topology."
msgstr ""
"En un clúster GFS2 de dos nodos, ambos Hosts se hacen ping mutuamente "
"por TCP 7443 y también deben alcanzar la Worker URL del Distributed "
"Worker. No aplique la verificación cruzada de pares del mismo sitio a "
"esta topología."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:32
msgid ""
"On a stretch cluster, reachability is confirmed by a majority of same-"
"site peers. Site-level arbitration is documented in "
":doc:`stretch_clusters`."
msgstr ""
"En un clúster stretch, la accesibilidad se confirma mediante una "
"mayoría de pares del mismo sitio. El arbitraje a nivel de sitio se "
"documenta en :doc:`stretch_clusters`."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:35
msgid "Majority Calculation"
msgstr "Majority Calculation"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:37
msgid "The quorum algorithm uses a simple majority formula:"
msgstr "El quorum algorithm usa un simple majority formula:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:39
msgid "neededForQuorum = (totalNodes / 2) + 1"
msgstr "neededForQuorum = (totalNodes / 2) + 1"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:43
msgid ""
"``totalNodes`` counts every Agent quorum member. On a two-node GFS2 "
"cluster that includes a Distributed Worker witness, there are three "
"members and majority is 2 of 3."
msgstr ""
"``totalNodes`` cuenta cada miembro del quórum del Agent. En un clúster "
"GFS2 de dos nodos que incluye un testigo Distributed Worker, hay tres "
"miembros y la mayoría es 2 de 3."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:45
msgid ""
"Agent quorum is the operational authority for layouts 1.3 and 2.0. "
"Corosync ``Quorate`` does not decide Agent quorum and may report ``No`` "
"on a healthy two-node or stretch cluster. See :doc:`building_clusters` "
"and :doc:`troubleshooting`."
msgstr ""
"El quórum del Agent es la autoridad operativa para los diseños 1.3 y "
"2.0. El valor ``Quorate`` de Corosync no decide el quórum del Agent y "
"puede indicar ``No`` en un clúster de dos nodos o stretch en buen "
"estado. Consulte :doc:`building_clusters` y :doc:`troubleshooting`."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:48
msgid "Witness Topologies"
msgstr "Topologías de testigo"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:50
msgid ""
"A Distributed Worker can provide a quorum-only vote for two supported "
"GFS2 topologies. |morpheus| classifies the witness from Site Group "
"presence, not from Host count. Agent quorum is sent only for layout 1.3 "
"or later clusters that have at least one HPE Shared File System (GFS2) "
"datastore."
msgstr ""
"Un Distributed Worker puede proporcionar un voto de solo quórum para "
"dos topologías GFS2 admitidas. |morpheus| clasifica el testigo según la"
" presencia de Grupos de sitio, no según el número de Hosts. El quórum "
"del Agent solo se envía para clústeres de diseño 1.3 o posterior que "
"tengan al menos un almacén de datos HPE Shared File System (GFS2)."

